From 24e66abed5f63fdedb52998fb2f6133d2485d8d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Albin Joy <albinjoy@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 04 Nov 2024 06:15:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-201944] Make graph key same when scale values are same.

Avoid recipe cache misses due to different scale tensors
with same scale value through:
1. Use the scale value for graph key hash instead of const_id
 for scale const tensor.
2. Make same const_id for scale tensors having same value.

Change-Id: I0c65cd6f32eae76cb5b66202d89a136bc0fa21ed
Signed-off-by: Albin Joy <albinjoy@habana.ai>
---

